      "tips": [
        "Use fresh lime juice and taste before straining; adjust syrup by 1/4 oz at a time to dial balance.",
        "Shake hard with cold ice for 12-15 seconds to get proper chill and dilution.",
        "Keep the salt rim light and on the outer edge so it seasons, not overwhelms."
      ],
